            "title": "國際｜克里米亞大橋鐵路恢復通車 澤連斯基稱烏方打擊屬回應俄軍",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜克里米亞大橋鐵路恢復通車 澤連斯基稱烏方打擊屬回應俄軍\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/616f0ec9de9bd5e8d7347b61a0073cd0f87aa623da92ff7e3eadbb2565717b9a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜克里米亞大橋鐵路恢復通車 澤連斯基稱烏方打擊屬回應俄軍</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">俄羅斯副總理尼基京表示，克里米亞大橋的鐵路段已全面恢復列車通行。該橋連日遭烏克蘭軍方襲擊，結構受損，交通一度受阻。烏克蘭總統澤連斯基與英國國防大臣施卓添會晤時指出，俄軍在烏方打擊該橋之前，已用導彈和無人機向烏克蘭境內橋樑發動過百次襲擊，烏方行動是對俄軍連番襲擊烏克蘭橋樑的回應。他認為，俄方持續攻擊烏克蘭基礎設施，反映莫斯科無意結束戰爭，並正為升級戰事尋找藉口。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT Telegram: <br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2M63TRO;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2M63TRO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2M63TRO</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Subscribe FORTUNE INSIGHT YouTube channel:<br/><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:http://bit.ly/2FgJTen;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"http://bit.ly/2FgJTen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">http://bit.ly/2FgJTen</a></p></div>",
